+// Quality ceiling for rate control: discard every coefficient refinement whose weighted distortion
+// per byte saved falls in a rate-control bucket below `bucket`, even when the frame fits its byte
+// budget. 0 (default) fills the budget. Buckets are about 1.5 dB apart.
+PYROWAVE_PUBLIC_API pyrowave_result
+pyrowave_encoder_set_quality_floor(pyrowave_encoder encoder, uint32_t bucket);
 
